{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-16_beg",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-16",
  "title": "Death of a Patriot",
  "storyCode": "7-18",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-16_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6b592396cc6da58d58df22ca7adbf5a09ce2e1b67749cf3612c4090786c4b6a5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "It's been a long time, Buldrokkas'tee.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Dame, Kal'tsit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Why don't... you age?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Shieldguards. Guerrillas. Stand by. Hold position.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "text": "Roger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Lord.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "The way you talk... is that because of an infected organ in your larynx?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "No. Just, over time, became like this. I can't, speak smoothly, anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Dame... I never thought, I'd see you, again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "I remember, faintly. When my people, left. You and, Her Majesty, didn't stop us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "That was a long, long time ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "I was, in my prime. Now I know, too sudden. I was wrong, about the King.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "...You'll still call her 'Majesty' and 'King.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "A king, is a king.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "When I left, she wasn't. Now, she has passed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "You still distinguish the King of Kazdel and the Emperor of Ursus.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Decorum. War does not, muddle, my thoughts. Who I served? All gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Ursus now, is my homeland, too. My liege, buried in Ursus. Vast land.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "...To long, Dame. When we left...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "My people were, not yet withered. Still, it was not, long.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "But you... no change. The years, did not change you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Not true. The years have changed us all, Buldrokkas'tee. I'm not the same woman I was before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Buldrokkas'tee... why did you leave Kazdel?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Why I left, I think, you will laugh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "I left, because, I hated killing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "...But for my life, I have killed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "All that you've been through has only tempered your will. Your blood still flows in your veins. I will not laugh at you. You've earned respect.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "High praise, Dame. I failed to avoid, killing. I did, kill so many.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Dame, this name... Do you know, how I got it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Your followers consider you a true warrior, fighting for Ursus. You fight injustice, slavery, bloodshed and oppression for the future of Ursus.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Do you agree?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "(Shakes his head)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "Even if war, is necessary, such a title, is trouble.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "For many, we started war. But war, is murder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "The war ends. If it, truly, ends. We should, all die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "But war never ends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "But I will die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "But, for my death, I want, meaning. I want to see, for Ursus, for the Infected, another future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "I asked, many times, of my people, Kazdel. You and, Her Majesty, worked together, for many years. She trusted you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "So, I too, trust you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "You led, Rhodes Island, here. Not for blood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patriot",
      "text": "...But them, those two. They stink, of my daughter. Her death.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Me? And... Amiya...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Mr. Patriot...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "FrostNova died to test us—",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "No. No more.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Do you seek vengeance on Rhodes Island, Patriot?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "No, Dame. Not vengeance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Why take, vengeance, for her, actions?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "That was, her path. She chose. No matter, where it ended.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Your daughter fought us with everything she had!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "She was strong.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "FrostNova had an iron will.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "And she approved of us too.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Quiet.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...What?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...Mr. Patriot?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "She's, so young. Only knows, blind trust.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "The truth, we believed, in the end, is exposed. Only a few, wolves, in sheep's clothing.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You...!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Mr. Patriot! Miss FrostNova gave her life, her Arts... everything...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Miss FrostNova let go of everything just to prove herself, her anger, her ideals...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Her life had meaning!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Enough. Not your place, to say this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Oh...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "(Amiya, don't. Say no more.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "What, do you know?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "If my daughter, was not, terminal... Killing you, would be easy, for her. Like slicing wheat, with a sickle.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "What you, endured, I do not care.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "It means, nothing. It proves, nothing.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Talulah has set the core city on a collision course for Lungmen!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "And is she, declaring it, Ursus territory?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "How did you know?!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Seems like we can skip that part.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Patriot... how... then why...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "The puppetmaster, has many tools. Puppetmasters, think alike.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "But I cannot, let you through. Reunion, cannot destroy, itself.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I won't, betray again. Or they, the Infected, the struggle, are for nothing. They die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Even if, Talulah, has gone mad...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "How do I tell, the Infected, their leader, is mad? A traitor?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "How do I say, she is wrong now, but once right? How do I say, she, who you follow, must now die?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I won't let, Reunion, become 'Infected, civil war, then nothing.' I will not.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "But Reunion won't be able to carry its own weight. And besides, Talulah has been working secretly to destroy Reunion from within.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You are right, Dame Kal'tsit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "And so, you are here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I prepared, to face, many types of foe.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "But I did not, expect, in the end, to fight Infected.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "...Is this really what you choose?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Buldrokkas'tee... You don't have to die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Choose? I have only, one choice.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "To kill you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Patriot, we don't need to throw more lives away! This isn't like it was with Miss FrostNova! No matter who wins, this battle is playing right into the enemy's hands!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Wrong.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Cautus, this, is war.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You want me, to stop. Why, should I stop?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I fought far, too many wars.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "As the, Wendigo, of Ursus... barbarians. Flayers, ripped flesh from bone, vicious herds, we cleansed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Monsters. Twisted, stinking limbs, eyes in the, hundreds. Fingers in, the thousands. We slaughtered.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Warriors. Victoria, with steam armor. Kazimierz, with Silverlance Pegasi. Laterano, with Apostolic, Gun-Knights. All of them, we defeated, utterly.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "But we cannot, defeat ourselves. Cannot defeat, the Empire's greed. Cannot defeat, our people's deaths.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "We, the Wendigos, are the Sarkaz, closest, to death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You are stained, with my daughter's death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "In this world, there are fates, worse than death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Why should I stop? Who dares, test me? My virtue?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "They called me, righteous. Should I, accept?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Fate thinks me weak. Do I suffer it? They called me strong. Should I bear it?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Traitor, rebel, butcher, guardian...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "All of them, like 'Patriot.' On the battlefield, they are nothing, but scraps.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Rhodes Island...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You killed her. I'll kill you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "It is not, revenge. I have no heart, for vengeance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "My daughter just, gave up the fight.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "No!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "That's not how it is, sir.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "If not, then how? She gave her life, and you still live?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I, will not, give up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I only know, what I see. I only know, what I hold.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I don't fight you, for my daughter.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "...But I loathe fate.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I will fell it, crush it, grind it to dust.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "If fate, lets you, make me turn.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I would rather, never turn, back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
          "text": "...Captain! Are you really going to...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Anyone who, thinks me, dishonorable. Stand now, challenge me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "But if you, value your life... We part, here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I don't want, for you, a foolish death. I won many times. I know this, too well.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "You can't...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Buldrokkas'tee, don't be stupid, you can live on.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Dame, you too, have tasted loss.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "And so, could you, stand by, and watch?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "—You—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "My blood, no longer, serves her. Yes. My country... is Ursus.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "But when she, died. We heard it... that long, long gasp.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "So you could feel it...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "That was the moment with the pulse containing her Arts spread through the body of every Sarkaz in the world.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "It was only an instant. But you felt it. That means your blood... is ancient enough.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "So ancient that, I am alone.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I never thought, born in Kazdel, never Infected... Then, an old man, I tasted it, Oripathy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Is that right?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "We all know, Dame. We all know. Things in this world, do not happen, because they are, right.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "In fact, most things, are mistakes, again.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "My men said, I can fix them. In fact, they are too many. There is no, looking back.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Do you fight, to this day, for what, you lost, Dame?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I think, no.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I think, you lost, and you refuse, to lose more.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "My daughter, has passed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "—I fight not, for her death. I fight, for the living, for all Infected, to the end.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Reunion, cannot fail.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Reunion must, liberate. All Infected.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "Are you sending messages for him and his men?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "What will you say to him?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "...You're trying to set up the guerrillas. You're... you're going to turn the Ursus Infected against them, to kill them.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "You know they won't raise a hand against the civilians.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "Hate is the strongest weapon. It's a killer.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "But he won't die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He's Patriot... he's all the greatest legends summed up in one man. I've seen his armor. I've seen him swing a weapon.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He can't die! He and his people are the strongest fighters in all Reunion!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "You want to kill the Infected. You devils never cared about life, but he does!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He's Ursus... he's Sarkaz, and he's Infected! But none of those qualities push him to do wrong!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He's not just Ursus, he's not just Sarkaz, he's not just an Infected. He's the Patriot, just the Patriot.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He'll beat you, he'll block your attacks, spit on your insults, regroup the Infected, and cleanse their hate...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "He's Patriot, and he won't die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "text": "And you're a bunch of maggots, dancing on the strings of the disgusting schemers running this show.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "You're talking like that because you know you're gonna die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "And you're definitely right about that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
          "text": "Patriot's pretty tough. But you're not. You're gonna die.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "So you, will not pass. I will not, allow it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "To go through, central district, you have to, kill me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Otherwise, my guerrillas, will hunt. And I, will be here, strangling you, to death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You will die, at my hands.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Only if, you kill me, will your value, be known. Otherwise, you are only, intruders.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's wrong with you?!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...How unreasonable.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I'm afraid I don't really follow.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Of course, I don't believe, you have any, value.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I don't know, how you could, resist, my people's, witchcraft. But you will not, survive, Ursus tactics.",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You really hate us that much?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I don't hate, anyone.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I just don't, trust you. I cannot, trust.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Even you, Lord. You brought...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "You won't approve of us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I don't believe, in coincidences.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "War.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "War, does not care. Not about right, or wrong.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "It does not, care about, the suffering, or the oppressed, or the enslaved. Off the battlefield, there are. On the battlefield, there are not.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You must prepare, for the battlefield.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Whoever dies, is wrong.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "text": "I can't... I can't understand him...!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
          "text": "What is he saying... why do we have to fight?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Fight, or be crushed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Resist, and be crushed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Unless, you defeat, me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "If fate, stands with me, I kill you. Then I, shall kill it. So it cannot, mock anyone, ever again.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "If fate, stands with you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I can only, go forward. Advance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "All operators, fall back, immediately!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I step forward.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Our target is an Infected commander of the Reunion movement, code name: 'Patriot.'",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "His armor, his strength, his stature, far surpass anything you would expect of a warrior.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Originium may have taken over many of his physiological functions. The Originium in what was once his larynx... is a product of the high rate of crystallization happening inside his body.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "That's the most we've been able to gather from our intel.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "I have reason to believe that a typically fatal wound will not do any significant damage to him, as the Originium will grow and replace tissue damage!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Wendigos naturally exhibit an extremely high metabolic and repair capacity. And from where we stand, we don't know whether his infection is causing him pain, or is a benign mutation.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "But no matter how resilient he may be, we have to kill him.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Only by killing him can we get through the central district, reach the bridge, and stop the enemy's exploitation of Reunion!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "His guards have been confused by his actions. This is our last chance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's happening?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...Why?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "How did it come to this?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "...We're just a fork in his road. All that we've built means nothing to him.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We're a choice just like 'go kill Talulah right now.' But I think that one carries more weight to him, might be worth further investigation.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "To put it frankly, he's looking down on us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Even with Dr. Kal'tsit here...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Even the Emperor of Ursus himself couldn't get him to bow his head, let alone me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "We'll have to use his death... to open his eyes, and make him see all that we've done, and make him realize that we're stronger than him.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "But there's no way he himself could ever... change. Everything else, all that you value, is too fragile for him. It can't bear his weight.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Hellagur from Azazel misjudged this Sarkaz's character.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "...No matter how noble Buldrokkas'tee may be, no matter how much he carries on his shoulders, he is an indomitable warrior, first and foremost.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "FrostNova trusted you, so she gave the last bit of her life to you... But Patriot does not.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "He doesn't trust. He only trusts himself.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "(...Even outwardly.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "Prepare for battle. It all comes down to battle now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "text": "—Only war can kill him.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Wise choice, Lord.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Guerrillas, regroup.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "You have only, a few minutes left.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I say, no more.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "I seek no, understanding. I only, win wars.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Defying all comprehension, the monstrously fearsome warrior stands before you.\nBut, you remember, there is another monstrous warrior who comprehends everything, standing right beside you...\nAmiya grips your hand tightly."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Patriot",
          "text": "Rhodes Island, I advance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
